  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ヒメフウチョウソウ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%92%E3%83%A1%E3%83%95%E3%82%A6%E3%83%81%E3%83%A7%E3%82%A6%E3%82%BD%E3%82%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 111314268,
      "text": "ヒメフウチョウソウ はフウチョウソウ科フウチョウソウ属の一年生草本。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Cleome viscosa",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleome_viscosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1314355836,
      "text": "Cleome viscosa, the Asian spiderflower or tick weed is an annual herb that grows up to a meter high. It belongs to the family Cleomaceae. It is considered an invasive species and is widely distributed in warm and humid habitats across the Americas, Africa and Asia, and in Australia. It is commonly found during the rainy season."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Cleome viscosa",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleome_viscosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 158565707,
      "text": "Cleome viscosa es una especie perteneciente a la familia Cleomaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cleome viscosa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleome_viscosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 203974361,
      "text": "Cleome viscosa est une espèce de plantes herbacées communes de la famille des Cleomaceae. Elle pousse sur toutes les terres arides, en plein soleil, mais aussi dans les zones forestières. Elle a une teneur en huile de 26 %."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Cleome viscosa",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleome_viscosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29215372,
      "text": "Cleome viscosa atau gulma kutu adalah terna tahunan dan termasuk ke dalam keluarga Cleomaceae. Tumbuhan ini tumbuh di habitat yang lembap dan hangat. Biasanya ditemukan sebagai gulma di lokasi yang terganggu, kebun, sawah, padang rumput, kebun buah, tanah telantar, dan di sepanjang pinggir jalan. Tumbuhan ini berasal dari Asia dan menyebar ke daerah Afrika dan Amerika. Di Indonesia, tumbuhan ini dapat ditemukan salah satunya di Gunung Prau."
    }
  },
